                <p>For text of Joint Communiqué of November 1, 1943, see <ref
                        target="frus1943v01#pg_741">vol. <hi rendition="#small-caps">i</hi>, p.
                        741</ref>; for substance of General Eisenhower’s announcement of November
                    10, 1943, see <hi rendition="#italic">United States and Italy, 1986–1946</hi>,
                    p. 76.</p>
